## Included in this release / 本版本包含

### Backend / 後端 (backend/)
- FastAPI REST API: health, translate, RAG search, recognize (demo stub)
- WebSocket: /ws/translate for live translation
- Hybrid RAG: BM25 + Zhuyin n-gram fusion
- Google Gemini integration (mock when API key is unset)
- PyTorch recognizer hook (loads ml/checkpoints/cnn_lstm.pt when present)

### Frontend / 前端 (frontend/)
- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite
- Camera preview (WebRTC / MediaDevices)
- Swiper language picker (zh-TW, zh-CN, en, ja, ko)
- Demo sign-recognition buttons → full translate pipeline
- REST and optional WebSocket client

### Machine learning / 機器學習 (ml/)
- MediaPipe Holistic keypoint extraction (extract_features.py)
- CNN+LSTM training scaffold (train_cnn_lstm.py, pending labeled data)
- Dataset layout: dataset/features/, dataset/labels.csv, checkpoints/

### Data / 資料 (data/)
- Zhuyin RAG corpus: data/zhuyin_corpus/*.json (40+ sample phrases)
- Raw media slot: data/raw/ (videos, MOE word list — user-provided)
- Evaluation template: data/eval/homophone_pairs.template.json

### Scripts & tooling / 腳本與工具 (scripts/)
- dev.sh — run backend + frontend together
- import_corpus.py — add RAG corpus entries
- eval_rag.py — Top-1 / Top-3 evaluation (needs homophone_pairs.json)

### Documentation / 文件 (docs/, root)
- README.md (English), TODO.md (bilingual checklist)
- CITATION.bib — BibTeX for academic citation
- LICENSE — MIT

### Infrastructure / 基礎建設
- GitHub Actions CI (backend import check + frontend build)
- .env.example — GEMINI_API_KEY, CORS, RAG_EMBEDDING_ALPHA

## Not yet included / 尚未包含
- Trained CNN+LSTM weights (requires labeled sign videos)
- bge-m3 / ChromaDB vector store upgrade
- Production deployment configs (Docker, cloud)
- MOE full lexicon import (waiting for user data)

## MVP criteria (v0.2.0 target) / 下一版目標
- Real-time Zhuyin output from camera or keypoints
- Reportable homophone RAG Top-3 accuracy
- End-to-end latency metrics for thesis
